FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FCCTV footage shows Luis Piovesana's
OL,8,Fmovements before he disappeared
OL,10,FMr Piovesana's family ` including his
OL,11,Fsister, the Olympic judo competitor
OL,12,FLubjana Piovesana ` attended his
OL,13,Finquest.
OL,15,FDr Peter Harrowing, the area coroner
OL,16,Ffor Avon, reached a narrative
OL,17,Fconclusion after hearing the evidence
OL,18,Fon Thursday.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FThe coroner said: "Luis Piovesana died
OL,8,Ffollowing immersion in water after
OL,9,Fentering the River Frome in Bristol
OL,10,Fsome time between February 28 and
OL,11,FMarch 3 2025.
OL,13,F"How he came to the water has not been
OL,14,Festablished."
OL,16,FHis sister, Lulu Piovesana, said the
OL,17,Ffamily has "more questions" following
OL,18,Fthe inquest conclusion.
OL,26,@oD@SOUuD@AOUvD@MO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,F"It was a narrative conclusion that he
OL,8,Fentered the water, they don't know how
OL,9,Fhe got in the water, they don't know
OL,10,Fhow he died the police had made an
OL,11,Fassumption he fell off a bridge but
OL,12,Fthey ruled that out saying that wasn't
OL,13,Fplausible.
OL,15,F"Now it's just more questions but I
OL,16,Fthink that's what we're going to have
OL,17,Fto live with, that we'll never know
OL,18,Fwhat happened that night.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,F"The police ruled early on that it was
OL,8,Fan accident. he'd been on a night out
OL,9,Fand had a good time but there were a
OL,10,Flot more things that played in to it.
OL,12,F"His cards had been stolen by known
OL,13,Fcriminals, and his clothing was
OL,14,Fdamaged and he made 999 calls so he
OL,15,Fwas obviously distressed. We just wish
OL,16,Fall avenues were explored which we
OL,17,Ffeel they weren't."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FIn response a spokesperson from Avon
OL,8,Fand Somerset Police said the
OL,9,Finvestigation carried out by police
OL,10,Fwas "thorough" and ran over several
OL,11,Fdays, with Luis' family being updated
OL,12,Fregularly throughout the process.
OL,14,FThey added that their thoughts remain
OL,15,Fwith Mr Piovesana's family.
OL,17,FMr Piovesana, who was born in Sutton
OL,18,FColdfield, had moved to the Frenchay
OL,19,Farea of Bristol to live with his
OL,20,Fpartner in September 2024.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FHe had a masters degree in engineering
OL,8,Fand was described as "deeply loved" by
OL,9,Fhis family and friends.
OL,11,F'He was always there for everyone'
OL,13,F"(At) his funeral, over 500 people
OL,14,Fshowed up which I think shows how
OL,15,Floved he was", his sister Lulu
OL,16,FPiovesana said.
OL,18,F"He was always there for everyone -
OL,19,Fthe life and soul of everything and
OL,20,Floved his girlfriend and his friends
OL,21,Fhis family.
OL,26,@pD@VOUpD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,F"It was his birthday weekend, he was
OL,8,Fcelebrating and it would have been
OL,9,Fnicer if it had ended in a celebration
OL,10,Fand not how it did."
OL,12,FThe inquest heard Mr Piovesana met
OL,13,Fwith friends for dinner and drinks on
OL,14,Fthe evening of February 27 before they
OL,15,Fwent to the Jam Jar music venue in St
OL,16,FAnne's, Bristol.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FHe consumed magic mushrooms,
OL,8,Fcontaining the psychedelic compound
OL,9,Fpsilocybin, before and during the
OL,10,Fevent, as well as further alcoholic
OL,11,Fdrinks.
OL,13,FFriends described the mushrooms as
OL,14,Fbeing big and contained in a sandwich
OL,15,Fbag.
OL,17,FThey said Mr Piovesana had taken magic
OL,18,Fmushrooms previously, without ill
OL,19,Feffect.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FIn the early hours of February 28, Mr
OL,8,FPiovesana became agitated and his
OL,9,Ffriends arranged an Uber to take him
OL,10,Fhome at 2.55am.
OL,12,FAt 2.59am, Mr Piovesana rang his
OL,13,Fgirlfriend and left a "distressed"
OL,14,Fvoicemail in which he said the taxi
OL,15,Fdriver was "trying to kidnap him", his
OL,16,Ffamily statement said.
OL,18,FHe also rang police on 999 at 3.03am,
OL,19,Ftelling the call operator that he had
OL,20,Fbeen drugged and was on the motorway.
OL,26,@uD@WOUuD@bO]wD@LOUwD@aO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FAt the same time, a motorist called
OL,8,F999 to report a pedestrian walking on
OL,9,Fone of the motorway lanes.
OL,11,FPolice officers attended the motorway
OL,12,Fat 3.19am but could not locate Mr
OL,13,FPiovesana.
OL,15,FDetective Inspector Peter Walker, of
OL,16,FAvon and Somerset Police, said the
OL,17,Ftaxi driver had not provided a written
OL,18,Fstatement but told officers he had let
OL,19,FMr Piovesana out of his vehicle by the
OL,20,Fmotorway slipway.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FCCTV footage then picked up Mr
OL,8,FPiovesana at the Eastgate shopping
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FThe last sighting confirmed by the
OL,12,Ffootage was at 3.24am, with Mr
OL,13,FPiovesana pictured approximately 450
OL,14,Fmetres away from sluice gates for the
OL,15,FRiver Frome, where his body was later
OL,16,Ffound.
OL,18,FDet Insp Walker described Mr
OL,19,FPiovesana's movements as "erratic" and
OL,20,Fsaid it was "clear that Luis was
OL,21,Fintoxicated" from the footage.
OL,26,@{D@ZOU{D@bO]|D@MOU}D@LO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,FHe said police had pieced together 12
OL,8,Fminutes of CCTV footage, showing Mr
OL,9,FPiovesana, and there was "nobody else
OL,10,Fabout" during that time.
OL,12,FMr Piovesana was reported missing by
OL,13,Fhis partner at 7.37am on February 28,
OL,14,Fwith an extensive search operation
OL,15,Fthen launched by police and his
OL,16,Ffriends and family.
OL,18,FThe coroner said: "Despite extensive
OL,19,Fsearches, sadly Luis couldn't be found
OL,20,Funtil March 3.
OL,26,@qD@ZOUrD@FO]zD@SOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/14
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40614
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786967344
OL,3,CSister of man whose body was found in
OL,4,Criver living with 'unanswered
OL,5,Cquestions'
OL,7,F"Divers found Luis's body in the
OL,8,Fvicinity of the sluice gates at the
OL,9,FRiver Frome in Bristol."
OL,11,FDet Insp Walker told the hearing it
OL,12,Fwas not possible to confirm where Mr
OL,13,FPiovesana had entered the water, or
OL,14,Fwhen he had done so.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G14/14
